[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     64[0m:[38;5;10m[49m rebuilt and run against the unmodified C, then reverted. Every one was caught:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     65[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     66[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | injected regression | detected by |
